Good news, Maria's just been offered a part-time specialty position

243
00:18:14,216 --> 00:18:14,616
Huh?

244
00:18:15,196 --> 00:18:18,756
That's nice, but what's a part-time specialty person do?

245
00:18:18,976 --> 00:18:20,456
You teach classes part-time

246
00:18:20,456 --> 00:18:23,036
So glad I have the greatest daddy in the world

247
00:18:23,036 --> 00:18:23,656
No way

248
00:18:23,656 --> 00:18:24,556
Serious?

249
00:18:24,836 --> 00:18:26,776
I'm a real-life teacher, not just pretend?

250
00:18:27,316 --> 00:18:27,656
Yep

251
00:18:27,656 --> 00:18:28,996
Think you can handle it?

252
00:18:29,076 --> 00:18:29,476
Totally!

253
00:18:29,876 --> 00:18:30,416
Heck yeah!

254
00:18:31,076 --> 00:18:31,556
Sweet

255
00:18:31,556 --> 00:18:33,316
We'll add that to the paperwork, then

256
00:18:33,316 --> 00:18:35,796
Yay, I'm a real teacher in a real school!

257
00:18:35,796 --> 00:18:37,216
Oh, I'm a real teacher in the room

258
00:18:37,216 --> 00:18:37,716
I'm a real teacher in the room

259
00:18:37,716 --> 00:18:38,996
I'm a real wife over there

260
00:18:38,996 --> 00:18:40,396
I'm a real markers and real racers

261
00:18:40,396 --> 00:18:42,076
And I'll get out real grays and real stickers!

262
00:18:42,596 --> 00:18:43,596
This is ridiculous!

263
00:18:43,756 --> 00:18:44,676
I won't allow it!

264
00:18:44,736 --> 00:18:44,956
Really?

265
00:18:45,056 --> 00:18:46,876
Because the president of the school thinks it's fine

266
00:18:46,876 --> 00:18:48,576
Because you didn't tell him the whole truth!

267
00:18:48,676 --> 00:18:50,636
Just because you decided to get an advisor now

268
00:18:50,636 --> 00:18:52,496
Doesn't mean the club wasn't founded illegally

269
00:18:52,496 --> 00:18:53,716
It's still not legit!

270
00:18:53,836 --> 00:18:55,296
Oh my god, shut your fly trap

271
00:18:55,296 --> 00:18:57,356
Listen, and listen well

272
00:18:57,356 --> 00:19:00,216
No matter how hard you work to get us shut down

273
00:19:00,216 --> 00:19:02,156
I can still make a phone call and have it reversed

274
00:19:02,156 --> 00:19:04,036
We have an advisor now, okay?

275
00:19:04,156 --> 00:19:05,176
You're knocking paid off

276
00:19:05,176 --> 00:19:06,176
You look like a hero

277
00:19:06,176 --> 00:19:07,316
You're freaking welcome

278
00:19:07,316 --> 00:19:08,556
I don't believe you!

279
00:19:08,776 --> 00:19:09,976
You're lying about something!

280
00:19:09,976 --> 00:19:11,316
You don't know when to quit, do you?

281
00:19:11,576 --> 00:19:13,636
This club and everything in it is mine

282
00:19:13,636 --> 00:19:15,316
I can do whatever I want

283
00:19:15,316 --> 00:19:17,416
So if you keep pulling the student council crap

284
00:19:17,416 --> 00:19:19,616
You won't be a member anymore

285
00:19:19,616 --> 00:19:22,196
If you'd rather not deal, I can have you expelled

286
00:19:22,196 --> 00:19:22,856
What?

287
00:19:22,996 --> 00:19:24,436
But you can't expel me!

288
00:19:24,556 --> 00:19:26,156
You want to test it and find out?

289
00:19:26,156 --> 00:19:28,076
You better hope you're right

290
00:19:28,076 --> 00:19:36,116
Sorry I ruined your meeting

291
00:19:36,116 --> 00:19:37,776
I hope you can forgive me

292
00:19:37,776 --> 00:19:42,676
And the club was saved by the rich girl

293
00:19:42,676 --> 00:19:45,116
Who abused her power and threatened to have someone expelled

294
00:19:45,116 --> 00:19:46,996
Well, I guess we know who the villain is

295
00:19:46,996 --> 00:19:49,516
Whatever, at least I got it done and we still have a club

296
00:19:49,516 --> 00:19:51,736
He made me Miss Kauru's bunny costume

297
00:19:51,736 --> 00:19:53,336
Did you do that for the club

298
00:19:53,336 --> 00:19:55,816
Or were you just trying to get back to your stupid bikini game?

299
00:19:55,996 --> 00:19:56,836
Be honest, Senna

300
00:19:56,836 --> 00:19:58,616
I was trying to finish the game

301
00:19:58,616 --> 00:20:01,396
At least we know her priorities will always be the same

302
00:20:01,396 --> 00:20:03,676
If that's all it took to get rid of her

303
00:20:03,676 --> 00:20:06,496
Then she's totally not worth stopping the game to try to impress

304
00:20:06,496 --> 00:20:08,576
If she was someone worthy of respect

305
00:20:08,576 --> 00:20:09,576
She would have ignored me

306
00:20:09,576 --> 00:20:11,796
And kept fighting for what she thought was actually right

307
00:20:11,796 --> 00:20:16,236
I do sort of feel bad for little Aoi

308
00:20:16,236 --> 00:20:19,376
But at least we know if Senna's around

309
00:20:19,376 --> 00:20:21,996
The neighbor's club won't be shut down anytime soon

310
00:20:21,996 --> 00:20:24,936
Oh, Kodaka, I have a question

311
00:20:24,936 --> 00:20:25,516
Hmm?

312
00:20:25,516 --> 00:20:29,976
Actually, Daddy reminded me of this when we were on the phone a little while ago

313
00:20:29,976 --> 00:20:30,536
What?

314
00:20:30,856 --> 00:20:31,696
Just curious

315
00:20:31,696 --> 00:20:33,796
Would you ever reconsider marrying me?

316
00:20:33,796 --> 00:20:39,416
It's been on my mind ever since the whole betrothal thing

317
00:20:39,416 --> 00:20:41,156
I mean, I've told you before

318
00:20:41,156 --> 00:20:44,996
I don't care about some stupid promise our fathers made to each other ages ago

319
00:20:44,996 --> 00:20:48,436
That is still true, but this time it's different

320
00:20:48,436 --> 00:20:50,416
Now, I don't care that the promise was made

321
00:20:50,416 --> 00:20:52,476
Because even if it's what our parents want

322
00:20:52,476 --> 00:20:53,436
It's what I want, too

323
00:20:53,436 --> 00:20:55,076
And I wish I'd never called off the wedding

324
00:20:55,076 --> 00:20:56,816
I know this seems kind of random

325
00:20:56,816 --> 00:20:58,636
But I totes love you and stuff

326
00:20:58,636 --> 00:21:00,696
It just kind of makes sense, you know?

327
00:21:01,096 --> 00:21:03,116
I'm sorry it took me a while to realize it

328
00:21:03,116 --> 00:21:04,256
What the hell are you saying?

329
00:21:04,256 --> 00:21:09,996
Hey, you made me lose the entire game

330
00:21:09,996 --> 00:21:10,756
I'm sorry?

331
00:21:11,096 --> 00:21:12,856
So, what were you saying before?

332
00:21:13,256 --> 00:21:14,716
Evs, I know you heard me

333
00:21:14,716 --> 00:21:19,836
Whoa

334
00:21:19,836 --> 00:21:23,316
I, uh, said that out loud, didn't I?

335
00:21:23,316 --> 00:21:27,816
Well, I was planning to tell you sooner or later anyway

336
00:21:27,816 --> 00:21:29,436
Wow, yeah

337
00:21:29,436 --> 00:21:31,396
So, um, now you know

338
00:21:31,396 --> 00:21:33,776
Let me know when you have an answer

339
00:21:33,776 --> 00:21:47,856
Um, the, uh, that game you were playing

340
00:21:47,856 --> 00:21:50,156
It's so loud I couldn't hear anything you said

341
00:21:50,156 --> 00:21:51,176
What was it again?

342
00:21:53,316 --> 00:21:58,576
Are you serious?

343
00:22:01,196 --> 00:22:03,756
Sorry, there's an important errand I forgot to run

344
00:22:03,756 --> 00:22:04,076
Ha!

345
00:23:41,794 --> 00:23:43,794
Found you, demon Astaroth!

346
00:23:43,794 --> 00:23:45,794
I have decided today I will use the magic

347
00:23:45,794 --> 00:23:47,794
my teacher taught me to destroy you.

348
00:23:47,794 --> 00:23:50,794
I admire your spirit, Guernica,

349
00:23:50,794 --> 00:23:52,794
and respect your right to destroy me.

350
00:23:52,794 --> 00:23:54,794
But you should know, I am your father.

351
00:23:54,794 --> 00:23:57,794
What? You're a horse! How is that even possible?

352
00:23:57,794 --> 00:23:58,794
It's actually a long story.

353
00:23:58,794 --> 00:23:59,794
I don't want to know.

354
00:23:59,794 --> 00:24:01,794
Hang on! One more and I'm out.

355
00:24:01,794 --> 00:24:04,794
Join us next time for the final episode of Haganai Next,

356
00:24:04,794 --> 00:24:06,794
I Blank Many Friends.

357
00:24:06,794 --> 00:24:08,794
My enemy, Nine-Line Breaker!

